:: D04_Phone_Jordan [nobr]
<<HUD>>

<<ImagePlaceholder "A phone screen lit up with a new text message, held against a couch cushion" "float" "assets/ui/phone/jordan-texting.png">>

<div class="prose-block">

<p>6:47 PM. My phone buzzes on the couch cushion. Unknown number.</p>

<p>"Hey it's Jordan from outside the store 😊 still think you're pretty btw"</p>

<p>I stare at the screen. Read it twice. Three times. A boy is texting me. A boy who met me for ninety seconds on a sidewalk and went home and waited hours and then typed out a message with an emoji and hit send.</p>

<p>The emoji gets me. The smiley face, like he's trying to project warmth through pixels, trying to make sure the text doesn't read as creepy. He's trying. It's kind of endearing.</p>

</div>

<div class="choice-block">
