:: D04_Jordan_Text_Sext [nobr]
<<HUD>>

<div class="prose-block">

<p>The texting starts casual but the undertow pulls it somewhere else. It happens gradually, one message at a time, each one a centimeter past the last.</p>

</div>

<<Dialogue "Jordan" "😎" "What are you wearing rn?" "">>

<div class="prose-block">

<p>He texts it at 9:14 PM, after an hour of back and forth that started at banter and has been slowly heating up. The question is a door. I can close it or walk through it.</p>

<p>I look down at myself. Oversized t-shirt, cotton panties, bare legs. My hair is down and messy. My face is bare. I look like a girl who was not expecting to receive a "what are you wearing" text and is now confronted with the reality of her own appearance.</p>

<p>"T-shirt and underwear. Very glamorous."</p>

</div>

<<Dialogue "Jordan" "😎" "That's actually pretty hot." "">>

<div class="prose-block">

<p>"It's a free XL shirt from a campus event."</p>

</div>

<<Dialogue "Jordan" "😎" "Still hot." "">>

<div class="prose-block">

<p>I feel the warmth spread across my chest, up my neck, into my cheeks. This body blushes easily. Marcus never blushed. Mia is a blusher. The blood rises and the skin flushes and there's nothing I can do about it even though nobody is watching.</p>

</div>

<<Dialogue "Jordan" "😎" "Prove it." "">>

<div class="prose-block">

<p>The request sits on my screen like a dare. Send a selfie. My first selfie as a woman. The phone's front camera has seen Marcus's face a thousand times for video calls and the occasional mirror check. It has never seen Mia.</p>

</div>

<<set $d04JordanTexted to true>>
<<set $jordan.flags.relation to "sexual">>

